 "text": "# Carousel\n\nType: Bootstrap drop-in. Write standard Bootstrap 5.3.8 markup. The kit only changes the look; no new classes are needed.\nSection: Componentes\nHuman version (rendered examples): componentes/carousel.html\nProse language: Brazilian Portuguese. Code, class names and identifier tables are language-neutral.\n\nSlides com controles. Derivação mínima do kit.\n\n```\n<div id=\"carEx\" class=\"carousel slide\" style=\"max-width:360px\">\n  <div class=\"carousel-indicators\">\n    <button\n      type=\"button\"\n      data-bs-target=\"#carEx\"\n      data-bs-slide-to=\"0\"\n      class=\"active\"\n      aria-current=\"true\"\n      aria-label=\"Slide 1\"></button>\n    <button\n      type=\"button\"\n      data-bs-target=\"#carEx\"\n      data-bs-slide-to=\"1\"\n      aria-label=\"Slide 2\"></button>\n    <button\n      type=\"button\"\n      data-bs-target=\"#carEx\"\n      data-bs-slide-to=\"2\"\n      aria-label=\"Slide 3\"></button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n    <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n      <div style=\"height:120px;background:#4569b9;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center\">\n        Slide 1\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <div style=\"height:120px;background:#1f6b2f;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center\">\n        Slide 2\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <div style=\"height:120px;background:#8a1c1c;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center\">\n        Slide 3\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <button\n    class=\"carousel-control-prev\"\n    type=\"button\"\n    data-bs-target=\"#carEx\"\n    data-bs-slide=\"prev\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Anterior</span>\n  </button>\n  <button\n    class=\"carousel-control-next\"\n    type=\"button\"\n    data-bs-target=\"#carEx\"\n    data-bs-slide=\"next\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-next-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Próximo</span>\n  </button>\n</div>\n```\n\nPara troca automática use data-bs-ride=\"carousel\". A animação respeita prefers-reduced-motion.\n\nDerived/invented (not in the original game)\n\nControles e indicadores derivados dos ícones de seta do jogo.\n\n## Variações\n\n- carousel-fade: troca com fade em vez de deslizar.\n- carousel-dark: controles e indicadores escuros (para fundos claros).\n- carousel-caption: legenda sobre o slide.\n- data-bs-ride=\"carousel\": troca automática; data-bs-interval=\"2000\" por slide.\n\n```\n<div id=\"carEx2\" class=\"carousel slide carousel-fade carousel-dark\" style=\"max-width:360px\">\n  <div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n    <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n      <div style=\"height:120px;background:#d5e0f6\"></div>\n      <div class=\"carousel-caption\">\n        <h5>carousel-caption</h5>\n        <p>Legenda do slide.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <div style=\"height:120px;background:#c8cdd3\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <button\n    class=\"carousel-control-prev\"\n    type=\"button\"\n    data-bs-target=\"#carEx2\"\n    data-bs-slide=\"prev\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Anterior</span>\n  </button>\n  <button\n    class=\"carousel-control-next\"\n    type=\"button\"\n    data-bs-target=\"#carEx2\"\n    data-bs-slide=\"next\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-next-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Próximo</span>\n  </button>\n</div>\n```\n\nNote\n\nAs classes carousel-item-next/prev/start/end são estados internos aplicados pelo Bootstrap durante a transição: você não as escreve.\n« Card · Botão fechar »\n",
